# CogGuard Project Context

- Before substantial work, read `doc/TODO_LIST.md`, `doc/ENV_SETUP.md`, `doc/DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md`, and `new-system/README.md`.
- Treat `doc/TODO_LIST.md` as the source of truth for current status, priority, and remaining work.
- Treat `new-system/` as the active development system.
- Use `CooRTweet-master`, `MediaCrawler-main`, and `NewsCrawler-main` as reference implementations only unless the user explicitly asks to modify them.
- If code and docs disagree, surface the mismatch and confirm direction before making major changes.
